  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "With the final blow, the towering machine collapses, its systems fading
    into silence. The factory that once imprisoned you begins to power down, its
    control slipping away at last. For the first time, there is no command, no restriction\u2026
    only choice.\nYou make your way to the surface.\nThe doors open, and beyond them
    lies a world you\u2019ve never truly seen, open skies, endless plains, and the
    quiet rhythm of nature. Freedom.\nSoon after your escape, enforcement officials
    arrive, alerted by the shutdown of the facility. The truth about what happened
    inside is uncovered, and the dangers of uncontrolled machines are brought to
    light.\nBut your journey doesn\u2019t end here.\nNow free, you set out into the
    world, not just to explore it, but to protect it. You dedicate your existence
    to ensuring that no machine is ever used to harm again. Where once you were controlled,
    you now stand as a guardian, proof that even something created for destruction
    can choose a different path.\nYour story is no longer confined by steel walls.\nIt
    has just begun."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fca1560c565d244b28ecbce2b0b32a06, type: 2}
